    "onboarding/amp_desc": "Aftermarket Parts Kits drastically change the functionality and appearance of your weapon.",
    "hash_35eecfe97930f15b": "AMP Kit Unlocked",
    "hash_523ec1fd5b0d584": "This is your current Armory Unlock Challenge. Complete Daily Challenge to earn 3 points a day. Earn more points once dailies are complete by winning matches.",
    "hash_52ac61fd5b6b3a0": "This is your current Armory Unlock Challenge. Complete Daily Challenge to earn 3 points a day. Once Dailies are completed, earn bonus points completing Contracts\n",
    "hash_50ede1fd59e61b0": "This is your current Armory Unlock Challenge. Complete Daily Challenge to earn 3 points a day. Once Dailies are completed, earn bonus points by surviving in Warzone matches for longer times.\n",
    "hash_7bafa6fa0c4f9d73": "Armory Unlocks in Multiplayer",
    "hash_7bc3b0fa0c60577b": "Armory Unlocks in Warzone",
    "hash_2f38c4ed3104002f": "Earn Raid Assignments by completing Daily Challenges in Multiplayer, Cooperative or Warzone",
    "hash_4ee25ac424a812bf": "Raid now available",
    "hash_3edec0f26336782b": "Unlock modifications slots to add attachments to your weapon. Adding attachments will enhance your weapons performance.",
    "hash_3edec1f2633679de": "Change your weapons appearance by adding camos, charms, decals and stickers.",
    "hash_3edec2f263367b91": "All 5 modification slots are unlocked through leveling your weapon. Weapon progression tree will give you a location to see all weapon platform unlocks.",
    "hash_3198c24cd2d8768b": "Build your Weapon",
    "hash_3198c34cd2d8783e": "Customize your weapon",
    "hash_3198c44cd2d879f1": "Add up to 5 modifications",
    "hash_5e45c62fd5b36740": "You can close the Global Panel from anywhere by pressing [{ui_start;global_panel}]",
    "hash_335843def76d44f2": "CLOSING THE GLOBAL PANEL",
    "hash_10cf25a547a73147": "The Global Panel gives you access to all kinds of features from your player profile to settings and more. Access the NEW Chat Channels feature via the Global Panel for better communication with friends.",
    "hash_2367842059d29c87": "GLOBAL PANEL",
    "hash_cc54ee75940c8d4": "Quickly access useful features from the new Global Panel menu. Open the Global Panel from anywhere by pressing [{ui_start;global_panel}]",
    "hash_5f0397bb7b85304e": "OPENING THE GLOBAL PANEL",
    "hash_434f546d8e9630cb": "Setup your own custom loadouts to tailor them towards your playstyle. From here, you can also access carry forward MWII items.",
    "hash_71bd535831fe10bc": "Edit Your Custom Loadouts",
    "hash_42ab9312d9abe240": "Create up to 10 loadouts.",
    "hash_1622abb9a405f076": "Create up to 12 loadouts.",
    "hash_3d357da2d0bea8e9": "Create Loadouts",
    "hash_486d7970778906f4": "Vote for your preferred Map in the time remaining. The match will take place on the map with the most votes.",
    "hash_28dfd2fc97f8c2c5": "Map Voting is Available",
    "hash_70067f5955cbf195": "Chat Channels are the home for text and voice chat in COD, keeping players connected socially across games, platforms, and play sessions.",
    "hash_5c9a00860dc5ed29": "Chat Channels",
    "hash_27e2d0c54eb1500b": "Games have separate settings. Changing a settings in a game might not affect the other automatically. You can manually try to import your settings by using the “Import” functionality found in the Account & Network section of the settings menu when applicable.",
    "hash_6bca38f1476631b3": "SETTINGS PER GAME",
    "hash_53ec6f42064c9f7f": "Complete the Modified Mode within the limited time to earn bonus stars.",
    "hash_18833cca615c405a": "Modifiers applied",
    "hash_62a73a7408edd33d": "New Daily challenges available every 24 hours for multiplayer and cooperative. Complete challenges to earn XP.",
    "hash_452d56e46ffcd201": "Daily Challenges",
    "hash_4262d252f36d6a84": "You can equip any unlocked Operator from either faction - Specgru or Kortac.",
    "hash_55cb8edce0b2edd5": "Equip Operators",
    "hash_4610286478b238bf": "Locked Operators can be unlocked through challenges or Store Purchases.",
    "hash_1d81e519b23d8cf8": "Locked Operators",
    "hash_50a8d742d2d80a32": "Select an equipped Operator to access available skins and finishing moves.",
    "hash_2390f0fe419c052f": "Operator Customization",
    "hash_2376758d25261e1e": "You can equip unlocked Operator Skins here.",
    "hash_35d31fca766ecab3": "Equip Operator Skins",
    "hash_28f7b3705350306d": "You can customize your finishing moves by interacting with this tab.",
    "hash_31d8c14ac1352c0a": "Finishing Moves",
    "hash_6f2d59a3f5b7aad0": "You can equip unlocked finishing moves here.",
    "hash_277f50ebf0d4a579": "Equip Finishing Moves",
    "hash_f337bf0a36b3e9": "View more details about the Mode by pressing [{ui_alt1}]",
    "hash_f334bf0a36aed0": "View expanded details about the Mode.\n\nToggle between the list of maps and game modes by pressing [{ui_shoulder_left}] or [{ui_shoulder_right}].",
    "hash_3a332c4906bc7e3e": "Mode Details",
    "hash_1549591acb4637d7": "Quick Play allows you to search for multiple modes at a time. Press [{ui_alt1}] here to select the modes you want to play.",
    "hash_33a529e78c1c0a0c": "Press [{ui_primary}] on any mode to select the modes you want to play.",
    "hash_1594a4d063e04e8d": "Quick Play Mode Selection",
    "hash_61311bf134f2dd07": "To deselect a mode, press [{ui_primary}] on any previously selected mode. You will no longer search for matches of this type.",
    "hash_78b864d159b8ced0": "Quick Play Mode Deselection",
    "hash_694879023f4824e0": "Quick Play",
    "hash_79fb57a284126ffc": "Use find a party to search to match with other players for Raid",
    "hash_5eb81a0ff9c06b34": "FIND A PARTY",
    "hash_689551f66cb1f6b4": "You can only enter the Raid by forming a party of 3 players",
    "hash_7c9a60a0db86fa1c": "SQUAD UP",
    "hash_46c24677d286cd1f": "A Receiver is the frame of the weapon. Each Receiver is highly modular with interchangeable attachments.\n\nCustomize your weapon to match your combat preference.",
    "hash_36234923af7d2a2f": "Swap your receiver",
    "hash_5f2502ff51f9c8eb": "Now that you have fully leveled this weapon, you can tune certain modifications when they are equipped.",
    "hash_216cd5073439225c": "Tuning",
    "hash_6ca323cc41506817": "Adjust the characteristic of your modification to enhance your gameplay.",
    "hash_6ca324cc415069ca": "Adjust the tuning and view how it changes your modification characteristics.",
    "hash_7bab822b10e46fcf": "Tuning",
    "hash_7bab832b10e47182": "Slide left and bottom bars",
    "hash_398506d6a20c144d": "Additional Vests have been unlocked!\nSelect to equip a Vest.",
    "hash_13358fcc54bd3d6a": "Additional Vests Unlocked",
    "hash_52afd6d270e8929a": "Each weapon has its own 4 unique camos. Complete the challenges to unlock and apply these camos to all of your weapons.",
    "hash_52afd5d270e890e7": "Your entire collection of camos. Unlock to apply to any weapon.",
    "hash_52afd4d270e88f34": "Complete extra challenges to earn exclusive weapon rewards.",
    "hash_51f14a471afad4ce": "Weapon Specific Camos",
    "hash_51f149471afad31b": "All Weapon Camos",
    "hash_51f148471afad168": "Weapon Mastery",
    "hash_49f78f174f1befcb": "Toggle through weapon classes to view different weapon types.",
    "hash_475801ca55419dbc": "Browse Weapon Classes",
    "hash_4953cdbc9a31a140": "Your armory holds all your saved and blueprint weapons.",
    "hash_12d02c14f40235e9": "View Your Armory",
    "hash_1d29b02c8bd2b3a7": "View and edit the weapons you have setup for each mode from loadouts and killstreaks. Weapons for each mode can also be accessed via the lobby when playing in a playlist.",
    "hash_16cf96d92cdaac2b": "WIN_TOKENS_DESC",
    "hash_11c8fb0cb726f893": "WIN_TOKENS_HEADER",
    "hash_3d1ed4cf1633bdb2": "Continue to MW4 BETA",
    "hash_62b4982541cf700e": "Explore the all new Warzone Zodiac Resurgence map in the MW4 Beta. Learn key landing zones, power positions, and rotations before Season 1 launch. Level up and unlock Beta rewards along the way.",
    "hash_68a625f20f5c69ca": "Calling all Warzone players",
    "hash_2292b0eff5440b7b": "WARZONE IS LIVE IN THE MW4 BETA",
    "hash_2c2ade0d55129573": "Black Ops 7 Endgame is now Free to Play! Infil solo or with a Squad of up to 4 players. Venture into escalating zones of danger to battle The Guild and Cradle-Induced hallucinations.",
    "hash_2c2adf0d55129726": "Power up your Operator's Combat Rating to earn Upgrades and Skills. Take on powerful Bosses in exchange for rewards. Escape and keep your progress.",
    "hash_2c2ae00d551298d9": "Unlock Endgame-exclusive Weapon Camos, Operator Skins, Calling Cards, Reticles, and more!",
    "hash_120957908c7d8683": "Avalon Overrun",
    "hash_120958908c7d8836": "Power Up & Survive",
    "hash_120959908c7d89e9": "Camo & Rewards",
    "hash_4a27405ebe917ec8": "Drop Into Endgame!",
    "hash_624540720a068fcc": "Reset to default",
    "hash_55b73557e4a6db0e": "Custom Color",
    "platform/melee_execution": "Finishing Move",
    "hash_74c45db1cae5755f": "Finishing Move",
    "playlist/dmz": "DMZ",
    "playlist/dmz_desc": "DMZ missions are back online. We have grown our area of operations. Ashika Island, DRC Building 21 and Al Mazrah have all been greenlit for infiltration. Accept contracts, explore side objectives, engage hostile enemy combatants, and search for valuable items, all while trying to complete your missions and get out alive.",
    "hash_1533f37d420834b6": "&&1",
    "hash_4a4fa50603002d73": "Master",
    "hash_26219bf4318461d8": "Go to 1-55 Level Unlocks now to instantly and permanently unlock an item of your choice",
    "hash_bf20df2f023cbb3": "Enter Prestige to continue your Progression journey and access exclusive rewards.",
    "hash_16e9268b823de73b": "Enter Prestige &&1 to continue your Prestige journey",
    "hash_937e1512ac3ef48": "Reach Max Level and then enter Prestige for additional rewards!",
    "hash_20b99dd0a4cc6a29": "Congratulations! You've completed all Levels",
